law.text:
		From such funds as may be appropriated or received, the Authority may make loans and grants for the benefit of qualified private, for-profit enterprises and public or not-for-profit enterprises, nonprofit industrial development corporations, or industrial development authorities for financing the following:

Purchase of real estate;


Grading of sites;


Water, sewer, natural gas or electrical line improvements, replacement and extensions;


Construction, rehabilitation, and expansion of buildings;


Construction of parking facilities;


Access roads construction and street improvements;


Purchase or lease of machinery and tools; and


Any other improvements deemed necessary by the Authority to meet its objectives.
